%% Diagramme de sequence - Enregistrement d'un bien (CU-04)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RS as Responsable structure
    participant W as web-app
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant S as asset-service
    participant O as organisation-service
    participant DB as asset_db
    participant QR as Generateur QR
    participant N as notification-service
    participant D as document-service

    RS->>W: Remplit fiche bien (designation, categorie, valeur, site)
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/assets
    G->>S: JWT valide ? route vers asset-service
    S->>O: GET /api/v1/structures/{id} (verification perimetre RG-06)
    O-->>S: Structure du demandeur
    S->>DB: Verification unicite code inventaire
    S->>DB: INSERT asset (statut = Enregistre)
    DB-->>S: asset_id + code_inventaire
    S->>QR: Generation QR code + etiquette
    QR-->>S: Image QR
    opt Pieces jointes
        W->>D: POST /api/v1/documents (multipart)
        D-->>W: document_id
        W->>G: Association document -> asset
    end
    S->>N: Evenement "bien enregistre" (RabbitMQ)
    N-->>RS: Notification confirmation
    S-->>G: 201 Created (fiche bien)
    G-->>W: Bien cree
    W-->>RS: Fiche bien + QR code telechargeable
